This product bundles or depends on the following third-party works.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tarja
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright Maria Alice Maia and contributors
https://github.com/macmaia/tarja
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

oculto-scan calls tarja to find and validate CPF, CNPJ (numeric and
alphanumeric) and PIS/NIS in cell text. The check-digit routines are
tarja's; this project does not copy them.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
defusedxml
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright Christian Heimes
https://github.com/tiran/defusedxml
License: Python Software Foundation License (PSF)

Used as the XML parser so untrusted workbooks cannot expand entities.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
oletools
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright Philippe Lagadec and contributors
https://github.com/decalage2/oletools
License: BSD

The optional extra ``oculto-scan[macro]`` calls oletools (olevba) to read
VBA source from vbaProject.bin. The Windows executable bundles the same
library. The macro is not executed and this project does not copy oletools.
Without the extra, a workbook with a macro is reported as not analyzed.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PyInstaller
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright Hartmut Goebel, Giovanni Bajo, and contributors
https://pyinstaller.org
License: GPL-2.0-or-later with the PyInstaller exception for the bootloader

PyInstaller is a build tool for the Windows executable. It is not imported
by the scanner. The executable is packed without UPX. The bootloader
exception allows distributing the resulting program under Apache-2.0.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Inno Setup
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright Jordan Russell and Martijn Laan
https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php

Inno Setup is a build tool for the Windows installer. It is not imported by
the scanner. The installer is packed without UPX. Inno Setup's license allows
distributing the installer produced with it.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
gitleaks
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright Zachary Rice and contributors
https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks
License: MIT

A small subset of secret-detection regular expressions in
src/oculto_scan/secrets.py is copied from the gitleaks configuration
(rules: aws-access-token, github-pat, gcp-api-key, slack-bot-token,
and the header of private-key). The Portuguese assignment rule
(senha / password) is original and is not a gitleaks pattern.

